     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Screening of legislation contributes to strengthening capacities in selected municipalities to enable financing of delegated functions.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legislative screening was completed and report published.
159 municipal staff (113 F) in 10 municipalities (Prrenjas, Lushnje, Tirana, Elbasan, Lezha, Puka, Pogradec, Kukes, Gjirokaster and Gramsh) trained to increase their skills on efficient and effective use of revenues and resources for delivering gender responsive social services; 
30 social security experts and Ministry staff trained on social security contribution collection and compliance of rural workers in Albania.</narrative>
      </comment>
